<title>FRANCE: Algerian minister kills himself cleaning gun.</title>
<headline>Algerian minister kills himself cleaning gun.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria's junior planning minister Ali Hamdi accidentally shot himself dead while he was cleaning his gun at home on Saturday, Algerian state-run radio said, quoting a government statement.</p>
<p>It gave no further details. Algerian ministers and senior officials carry arms to protect themselves and their families against Islamist rebels fighting the government.</p>
</text>
